@startuml
title 設計差分図: all-pages componentization - component view

top to bottom direction
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<existing>> #F7F9FC
    BorderColor<<existing>> #546E7A
    FontColor<<existing>> #243447
    BackgroundColor<<added>> #EEF9EF
    BorderColor<<added>> #2E7D32
    FontColor<<added>> #1B5E20
    BackgroundColor<<removed>> #FFF1F1
    BorderColor<<removed>> #C62828
    FontColor<<removed>> #7F1D1D
    BackgroundColor<<changed>> #FFF8E1
    BorderColor<<changed>> #F9A825
    FontColor<<changed>> #4E342E
    BackgroundColor<<risk>> #F4F7FA
    BorderColor<<risk>> #607D8B
    FontColor<<risk>> #1F2933
}

legend bottom right
    |= Style |= Meaning |
    |<#F7F9FC> existing | 変更しない接続先または既存維持 |
    |<#EEF9EF> added | この task で追加予定の部品または証跡 |
    |<#FFF1F1> removed | page から外す責務または禁止経路 |
    |<#FFF8E1> changed | 責務を寄せ直す既存 page |
    |<#F4F7FA> risk | 人間レビューで確認する判断注記 |
endlegend

package "production page boundary" {
  class "page components\n<<changed>>\nTranslationInputConfirmPage\nJobSetupPage\nTranslationJobManagementPage\nJobRunPage\nTermTranslationPage\nNpcPersonaPage\nBodyTranslationPage\nTranslationCompletePage\nOutputManagementPage\nMasterDictionaryPage\nProviderSettingsPage\nDashboardPage\nMasterPersonaPage" as Pages <<changed>>

  class "page responsibility after refactor\n<<changed>>\ncontroller 接続\nsubscribe\ndispose\nnotice\n表示部品合成" as PageRole <<changed>>

  class "page-owned large markup\n<<removed>>\n一覧 / 詳細 / panel / modal の\n大きな template 直書き" as PageMarkup <<removed>>
}

package "added screen-local component groups" {
  class "input / setup / dashboard groups\n<<added>>\nDataLoad*\nInputSourcePanel\nFoundationDataPanel\nPhaseSettingsPanel\nCompatibilityPrecheckPanel\nDashboardEntry*" as ScreenLocalA <<added>>

  class "job management / job run groups\n<<added>>\nJobManagementHeader\nFeedbackPanel\nJobListPanel\nJobCard\nJobOperationGroup\nJobRunTargetSummary\nJobUnselectedGuidance\nPhaseNavigationFooter" as ScreenLocalB <<added>>

  class "phase execution groups\n<<added>>\nTerm*\nPersona*\nBody*\nreadiness / result / failure panels" as ScreenLocalC <<added>>

  class "complete / output / dictionary / provider groups\n<<added>>\nTranslationComplete*\nOutput*\nDictionary*\nProviderSettings*" as ScreenLocalD <<added>>
}

package "candidate shared components" {
  class "existing shared reuse\n<<existing>>\nAIModelSelectionCard\nStickyActionFooter" as ExistingShared <<existing>>

  class "candidate shared set\n<<added>>\nStatusPill\nConfirmDangerModal\nPhaseStatusPanel\nPhaseActionPanel\nPhaseProgressPanel\nPhaseFailureInfoCard\nPhaseMetricCounterGrid\nPhaseNavigationFooter\nPaginationControls" as SharedCandidate <<added>>
}

package "storybook artifact boundary" {
  class "component stories\n<<added>>\n主要 panel / card / modal story\n一部 page 合成 story" as Stories <<added>>
  class "view model fixture\ncallback stub\n<<added>>\nfixed props only" as Fixtures <<added>>
  class "storybook-review.md\n<<added>>\nstory ID\nreview URL\n確認状態\n未確認理由\n再実行 command" as ReviewLog <<added>>
  class "page composition story overuse\n<<removed>>\n主要部品 story の不足代替" as StorySubstitute <<removed>>
}

package "unchanged production boundary" {
  class "production controller\nStore\n<<existing>>" as ControllerStore <<existing>>
  class "Gateway\nRuntimeEventAdapter\ngenerated wailsjs\n<<existing>>" as RuntimeBridge <<existing>>
  class "backend\nsecret store\nDB\nfilesystem flow\n<<existing>>" as BackendBoundary <<existing>>
  class "docs/screen-design 正本\n<<existing>>\n今回の task では直接更新しない" as ScreenDesignCanon <<existing>>
}

class "forbidden Storybook dependency\n<<removed>>\nruntime adapter\nGateway\ngenerated wailsjs\nsecret store\nDB\n実 filesystem flow" as StoryForbidden <<removed>>

class "review note\n<<risk>>\n共有候補は props 分岐が膨らむ場合\nscreen local へ戻す" as SharedReviewNote <<risk>>
class "review note\n<<risk>>\n既存表示項目\n状態文\n操作\naria-label は維持" as UiInvariant <<risk>>

Pages -[#F9A825]-> PageRole
PageMarkup -[#C62828,dashed]-> Pages

PageRole -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalA : compose props + callbacks
PageRole -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalB : compose props + callbacks
PageRole -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalC : compose props + callbacks
PageRole -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalD : compose props + callbacks

ScreenLocalA -[#546E7A]-> ExistingShared : reuse when fit
ScreenLocalB -[#546E7A]-> ExistingShared : reuse when fit
ScreenLocalC -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> SharedCandidate : common phase rules only
ScreenLocalD -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> SharedCandidate : common display rules only

Stories -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalA
Stories -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalB
Stories -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalC
Stories -[#2E7D32]-> ScreenLocalD
Stories -[#546E7A]-> ExistingShared : reuse story target
Stories -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> Fixtures : import fixed props
ReviewLog -[#2E7D32]-> Stories : record review target

StorySubstitute -[#C62828,dashed]-> Stories
StoryForbidden -[#C62828,dashed]-> Stories
StoryForbidden -[#C62828,dashed]-> Fixtures

Pages -[#546E7A]-> ControllerStore : existing production path
ControllerStore -[#546E7A]-> RuntimeBridge : existing production path
RuntimeBridge -[#546E7A]-> BackendBoundary : existing production path
UiInvariant -[#607D8B,dotted]-> Pages
SharedReviewNote -[#607D8B,dotted]-> SharedCandidate
ScreenDesignCanon -[#546E7A,dotted]-> UiInvariant : source of truth stays unchanged

note right of Pages
変更理由:
- page は production wiring と表示合成へ寄せる
- controller, Store, Gateway, backend は変えない
end note

note bottom of SharedCandidate
追加予定は候補である。
複数画面で同じ表示規則または操作規則を持つ場合だけ共有化する。
end note

note bottom of Stories
page 合成 story は密度確認と配置確認だけに使う。
主要 panel, card, modal の story を省略する理由に使わない。
end note

@enduml

@startuml
title 設計差分図: all-pages componentization - sequence view

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "利用者" as User
participant "page component\n<<changed>>" as SeqPage
participant "production controller / Store\n<<existing>>" as SeqController
participant "screen local component\n<<added>>" as SeqLocal
participant "candidate shared component\n<<added>>" as SeqShared
participant "Storybook story\n<<added>>" as SeqStory
participant "fixture + callback stub\n<<added>>" as SeqFixture
participant "storybook-review.md\n<<added>>" as SeqReview
participant "Gateway / RuntimeEventAdapter /\ngenerated wailsjs / backend\n<<existing>>" as SeqRuntime

== production render after refactor ==
User -> SeqPage : 対象画面を開く
SeqPage -> SeqController : create / mount / subscribe
SeqController --> SeqPage : viewModel updates
SeqPage -> SeqPage : notice と dispose を保持
SeqPage -> SeqPage : panel, card, modal ごとの props を作る
SeqPage -> SeqLocal : small props + callbacks
SeqLocal -> SeqShared : 共通表示規則がある場合だけ reuse

note right of SeqPage
[削除予定]
page 内の大きな markup 直書き
child への runtime 依存引き渡し
end note

User -> SeqLocal : 既存操作を実行する
SeqLocal --> SeqPage : callback
SeqPage -> SeqController : 既存 controller method
SeqController -> SeqRuntime : 既存 production path
SeqRuntime --> SeqController : existing response
SeqController --> SeqPage : updated viewModel
SeqPage -> SeqLocal : 状態文, disabled, aria-label を維持した props 更新

== Storybook isolated review path ==
SeqStory -> SeqFixture : synthetic props を読む
SeqFixture --> SeqStory : fixed props + view model fixture + callback stub
SeqStory -> SeqLocal : props only
SeqLocal -> SeqShared : props only

note right of SeqStory
[削除予定]
page 合成 story を主要部品 story の代替にしない
runtime adapter, Gateway, generated wailsjs を読まない
end note

note right of SeqFixture
[禁止]
secret
token
real endpoint
real user data
raw request / response / prompt
実 filesystem flow
end note

User -> SeqReview : story ID と review URL を記録する
SeqReview -> SeqStory : 確認対象 story を参照
SeqReview --> User : 確認状態 / 未確認理由 / 再実行 command を残す

note over SeqPage, SeqReview
変更しない接続先:
production controller
Store
Gateway
RuntimeEventAdapter
generated binding
backend
docs/screen-design 正本
end note

@enduml
